{
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "id": 15,
      "description": "Reading guide for this dashboard (added by the lab).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Upstream **Ztunnel** dashboard (Istio 1.30.8). ztunnel is the per-node L4 proxy of ambient mode (mTLS tunnels between enrolled pods).\n**No namespace is enrolled in ambient today** (`istio.io/dataplane-mode=ambient` absent), so the Network panels (Connections, Bytes,\nDNS) and the socket part of *Resource Usage* are empty by design: ztunnel exports istio_tcp_* / istio_dns_* only for traffic it carries.\nWhat works now: versions, CPU/memory, xDS connections/pushes from istiod, Workload Manager (0 active proxies), file descriptors. Details: `docs/dashboards/networking.md`."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Active alerts for this service",
      "id": 16,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Prometheus alerts of this service that are FIRING (condition true for longer than the rule's `for`) or PENDING (condition true, waiting for `for`). Same filter as the red alert annotations of this dashboard; Watchdog/InfoInhibitor are excluded. Empty = healthy. Alertmanager has no receiver in this lab, so dashboards are where alerts are seen: the rule, its threshold and source are in the rule files (helm-charts/<app>/**/prometheus.rules.yaml or the -raw release) and in docs/dashboards/. All alerts of the lab: dashboard \"Alerts overview\" (Observability folder).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertname!~\"Watchdog|InfoInhibitor\", alertstate=~\"firing|pending\", namespace=\"istio-system\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          },
          "noValue": "No active alerts"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "alertstate"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "state"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "basic"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "firing": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "pending": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "severity"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "critical": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "warning": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "info": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "index": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "prometheus": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "service": true,
              "instance": true,
              "uid": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "alertname": 0,
              "alertstate": 1,
              "severity": 2,
              "namespace": 3
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
